/**
 * The caverns.
 *
 * GENERATED by tools/export-world-cpp.mjs in the browser build. Do not hand
 * edit: change the layout there, where `npm run content` verifies that every
 * marker is reachable and every doorway has one pointing back, and export again.
 *
 * Three caverns in a chain rather than a hub. The Reach drops into the Deep,
 * and the Deep into the Vault. Each is harder than the last and holds slugs the
 * ones above it do not, so going deeper is how a blaster fills out.
 */

